Comment: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:21.78,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:28.79,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.11,0:01:36.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As the White Base fled Side 6...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.51,0:01:40.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the Conscon Mobile Unit\Ncontinued its relentless attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.33,0:01:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks to the Gundam and other machines,\Nthey were able to fight off the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:49.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, the full-scale battle\Nhas yet to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:20.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Third Fleet approaching us\Nfrom the stern!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:21.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}White Base, do you read me?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.62,0:02:24.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Loud and clear. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:27.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're entering formation.{\i}\N{\i1}Hold your course.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:29.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll align in formation.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:31.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prepare to receive supplies.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell him we acknowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:34.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Columbus supply ship coming into our bow\Nfrom starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.35,0:02:39.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get them to load the supplies quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.50,0:02:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go pay a visit to the fleet commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come I'm not allowed to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanna say hi to the commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.78,0:02:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is no errand for children!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:54.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let them treat you\Nlike a child either, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:56.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, help out with the supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:02:58.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's some ugly-looking thing\Ncarrying missiles, but what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.75,0:03:20.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a Public-type assault ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.14,0:03:24.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Assault ship?!\NMeaning we've got tough times ahead still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.23,0:03:25.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't like this one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:32.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:33.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.87,0:03:35.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The captain of the White Base has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.53,0:03:37.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.63,0:03:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Junior Grade Bright Noa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:43.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've done well, Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:46.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good to see you again,\NCommandant Wakkein.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:48.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Commandant" isn't necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:52.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I'm with the top brass,\NI'm quickly reduced to a minor officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:53.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're starting to look like a real commander.\NVery admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.11,0:04:04.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the course we're presently on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:07.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our main forces are taking a wide detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.70,0:04:09.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But this is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.73,0:04:12.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the target of the operation is Solomon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:17.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base will join us at\Nthe vanguard in our attack on Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.40,0:04:21.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so? That's a big responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:22.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we up to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fact that you're able\Nto look at it that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:28.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...proves just how confident you've become.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:29.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:34.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, sir. The White Base pilots\Nare all tremendously overworked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:35.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Especially Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, the Gundam boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.05,0:04:39.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He possesses an amazing talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:40.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's different from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Different? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just a feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.85,0:04:51.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The magnetic pressure won't increase.\NThat's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:55.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your dinner's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:04:59.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:03.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Just leave it there, please?\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:05.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't good...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:24.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's only one Big Zam on the Papua?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:26.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!\NAt present, that's all they...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.85,0:05:29.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is my brother thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Rick Doms we have won't be sufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:36.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not send us 10 Doms\Ninstead of one cutting-edge mobile suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:38.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:38.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:41.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This Big Zam is still in the prototype stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.11,0:05:46.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're rushing development, but they\Nhave so many requests from every front...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:47.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:48.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Assemble the Big Zam on the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:52.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haven't we located the Tianem Fleet yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:57.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:06:02.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're searching where the Minovsky particle\Ndensity is high, but with so many decoys...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you expect in a war?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.55,0:06:19.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry up with the supply loading!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:22.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Disengage conveyor pipes! Close off valves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:24.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Check the internal air pressure at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:25.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the harbor pilot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:37.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Prosecutor Cameron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:39.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you removed the weapon seals for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've removed the seals,\Nbut firing within Side 6 airspace is still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.12,0:06:44.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.94,0:06:48.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll leave soon.\NI don't want you to come here ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:50.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful with your words, Mr. Cameron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:52.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:55.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Side 6 has survived this long\Nbecause it's convenient for Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:58.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd do well to remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:01.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that we live by your whim?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:03.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah. What's taking you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:39.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is that young lady...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's like a sister.\NLet's leave it at that, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our fleet is currently situated{\i}\N{\i1}at the third battle line...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:22.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...from the enemy space fortress, Solomon.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're so close to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:27.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From here on, nothing stands between{\i}\N{\i1}the enemy and ourselves.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:34.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Changing fleet formation to lateral line!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:40.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow!\NWhere are Katz, Letz, Kikka?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.21,0:08:42.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In E-Block of the gravitational core.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haro, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:43.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:48.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do we have to stay here and be quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't fight unless we have these on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:53.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll make a frontal attack.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:56.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our Public assault ships{\i}\N{\i1}will create a beam interference field.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:58.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All vessels proceed directly ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:03.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be kidding. With a fleet this small,\Nthis is practically suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:07.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'll be fine, Mr. Kai.{\i}\N{\i1}The Federation has things worked out.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's easy for you to say, but...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:11.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough out of you, Kai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:14.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to put our faith\Nin Tianem's main fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:17.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You only need to hold out for 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:21.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, the main fleet will use\Nits anti-fortress weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anti-fortress weapon?\NWhat could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commence attack, minus 8!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:32.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All Publics, 3... 2... 1... 0!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:33.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.66,0:09:54.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well? What's up?\NHow far has the enemy closed in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.95,0:09:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! They're hiding in the debris of Side 4\Nas they continue to advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:00.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're now within targeting range!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. Shoot them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:01.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:14.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Missiles! Main cannons! Beam cannons!\NPrepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.89,0:10:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy has created\Na powerful beam interference field!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:51.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick Dom and Zaku forces,\Nprepare for enemy advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:56.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There aren't that many enemy vessels.\NSwitch to missile attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:58.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Milva Fleet, move to left wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:11:00.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Harvard Force, stay in the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tianem's main fleet will approach\Nfrom another direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The beam interference field is working!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:12.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good! All vessels,\Nproceed at your own discretion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.78,0:11:16.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launch our GM and Ball mobile suit forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:26.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mobile suits and G-Fighters,\Nbegin launching!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:28.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, this is a joint operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't fall behind, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:37.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I only hope the Zanzibar's not here.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:38.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla, launching!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:41.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guncannon, taking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.09,0:12:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, this is a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:42.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bastard...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:46.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here's the first shot...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:48.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And next up...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.01,0:12:57.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai. Don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.05,0:12:59.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla! I love ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:04.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La Coque. Take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:05.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:06.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:06.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:15.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just in case, I want all women\Nmoved to the escape capsules!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.59,0:13:20.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:22.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the battle going that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:28.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our Solomon will never fall.\NIt's just a precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.06,0:13:30.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just in case something happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:34.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For Mineva, who has finally blessed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:38.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You spoke too loudly...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:43.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A little closer... Closer... That's the ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:49.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:07.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Life or death?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one knows the outcome\Nuntil the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:14.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The only certainty is that\Nwith every beautiful sparkle in the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.71,0:14:17.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...people, or even hundreds of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:21.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...are becoming debris\Nlittered through space.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.93,0:14:41.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are the mirrors ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:42.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! About 4 minutes longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.89,0:14:45.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. Solomon should detect us about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:50.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fool! You just realized they're hiding\Namong the debris of Side 1?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.58,0:14:51.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:53.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Tianem's main fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.11,0:14:54.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launch the satellite missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.07,0:15:00.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:12.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send the battleship Gwaran and\Nsome Musais against their main fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.05,0:15:15.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should we ask the 7th Division for backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:16.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.44,0:15:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help from Kycilia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.51,0:15:21.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For such a minor skirmish...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:23.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd be the laughingstock of all Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.44,0:15:31.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirror deployment complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:34.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attitude control vernier linkage system: OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Solar System target: Solomon's right flank!\NThe space gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:54.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,10 seconds to axis alignment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.59,0:15:56.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Interceptors approaching!\NAll ships, be alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:58.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ignore them! Hurry with focus alignment!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.77,0:16:04.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,3... 2... Focus is now on target!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:25.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Solomon!? It's burning up! So that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:28.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The power of the Federation's new weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:34.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.89,0:16:37.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gate 6 has vanished!\NThe enemy's new weapon did this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.77,0:16:39.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:42.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing on radar!\NNo energy particle reactions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:45.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then it's some kind of laser?!\NFrom where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:47.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy's main fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't the Gwaran force headed there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:54.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is mega particle cannon 45.\NWhere should we be firing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:09.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is no good.\NThe cartridge lock is shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have to retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:17.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guntank has returned with level B damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:19.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The pilot is injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:23.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the Guntank's retreat,\Nfighting strength is down 11 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.19,0:17:24.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato's hurt?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The number of injured people is increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.73,0:17:28.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, let me go and help the medics!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:31.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Permission granted.\NBaro, take over for Fraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.94,0:17:34.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Petty Officer Masaki!\NPrepare for a transfusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.97,0:17:49.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll feel better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:50.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I do anything to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.01,0:17:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring a unit of type AB blood\Nand a transfusion set.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:56.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.76,0:17:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.31,0:17:57.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:01.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy main fleet approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:05.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launch all the satellite missiles\Nin orbit right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:16.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll have to give Hayato another unit\Nof blood after this one. Don't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:17.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incoming! It's a Dom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.38,0:18:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've fought more than enough already.\NNow it's time for you to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The others...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:35.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all fine.\NThey're out there fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:35.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so frustrating...\NI'm the only one in this sorry state.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:45.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't even keep up\Nwith Ms. Sayla and Mr. Kai...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.15,0:18:46.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:50.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Hayato?!\NYou're doing a fine job too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.12,0:18:55.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't try to comfort me, Fraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.02,0:18:58.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ever since I joined the White Base crew\NI've wanted nothing better...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:19:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...than to somehow beat Amuro.\NBut look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:04.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.67,0:19:07.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:11.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's different...\NHe's different from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,2nd and 6th Gattle combat squadrons,\Nno response! Gwaran, no response!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.19,0:19:28.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La Coque. Could you get me more coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.81,0:19:29.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.95,0:19:32.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pull back all remaining mobile suits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:34.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll wipe out the enemy\Nat Solomon's doorstep!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.47,0:19:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're retreating?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.39,0:19:51.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where should I force my way in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:56.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's where the new weapon got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:57.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:02.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:10.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Message from the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:13.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems that one of our mobile suits\Nhas entered Solomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good! Instruct all ships\Nto launch their mobile suits!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:18.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:19.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Titan calling all vessels!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.87,0:20:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send out your GM and Ball\Nmobile suit assault teams!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.23,0:20:38.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:02.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Solomon's requesting reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The message is encrypted,\Nso we don't have any details...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:10.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but Lady Kycilia's orders are\Nto head for Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:15.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah. Are you ready?\NYou're finally headed for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.28,0:21:21.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zanzibar! Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:23.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Destination, Solomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:25.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All hands to level 3 battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.47,0:21:44.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They finally left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:46.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:53.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the very least...\NI hope you live a long life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.61,0:21:56.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Zenna here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:21:59.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darling. Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.59,0:22:02.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly! Solomon will never fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.38,0:22:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to escape\Nand go to my sister's Granada base.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:07.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it that hopeless?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.76,0:22:10.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's going fine. Don't worry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.96,0:22:14.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of Mineva.\NMake sure she grows up strong, Zenna.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.28,0:22:17.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darling...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.07,0:22:19.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am a military man...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.80,0:22:22.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a soldier who will uphold\Nthe Zabi family tradition...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.89,0:22:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.37,0:22:29.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go, Zenna! And take Mineva!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.07,0:22:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Assemble mobile suit forces on the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.17,0:22:42.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy is about to land!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.92,0:22:45.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All remaining Rick Doms and Zakus!\NPrepare for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.68,0:22:49.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gattle combat squadrons, launch\Nas soon as your missiles are reloaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:53.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the Big Zam ready for combat?\NThe final battle is yet to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.55,0:23:00.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's the Big Zam...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:22.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vice Admiral Dozle's mobile armor\Nbrushes aside the Federation Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.70,0:23:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When Lieutenant Sleggar's desperate attack\Nbreaks through the enemy's defense...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.56,0:23:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...Amuro witnesses...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.29,0:23:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the shadow of hatred\Nthat dwells within Dozle's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.67,0:23:36.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NBig Zam's Last Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.01,0:23:40.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
